          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Fill Lungs"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "**Fill Lungs**\nDC: 26\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\n- Stage 1: sickened 1 (1 round)\n- Stage 2: sickened 2 (1 round)\n- Stage 3: sickened 3 (1 round)\n- Stage 4: drowning and cannot reduce below stage 4 until the water is purged Administer First Aid (which stops the creature from drowning and returns the creature to stage 3; stage 2 on a critical success) or a magical effect that removes curses or the sickened condition (which stops the creature from drowning and ends the curse). If the creature dies from drowning, it rises as a barnacle ghoul the next midnight."
            },
